Description: OpenTelemetry Python SDK
 OpenTelemetry is a collection of tools, APIs, and SDKs used to instrument,
 generate, collect, and export telemetry data (metrics, logs, and traces).
 .
 This package provides the OpenTelemetry Python SDK, the reference
 implementation of the OpenTelemetry API, including trace, metrics, and
 logs providers along with exporters, samplers, and resource detection.
 .
 This package provides the Python 3 library.
